  "siteDescExtended":"Check eligibility for China visa-free entry: unilateral 30-day, mutual visa exemption, 240-hour transit visa-free. Requirements, expiry dates and FAQ for foreign visitors travelling to China.",
  "siteDescExtendedZh":"来华外国人免签资格查询：单方面免签、互免协定、240小时过境免签；入境材料、政策到期时间、常见问题。",
  "introPara1":"This reference website summarizes China’s official visa-free entry policies published by the National Immigration Administration (NIA). Three major visa-free schemes apply to foreign nationals visiting China for tourism, business visits, family reunions or transit purposes. Always verify against official NIA announcements before departure, as policies carry expiration dates and may be adjusted.",
  "introPara1Zh":"本站汇总国家移民管理局发布的中国免签入境官方政策。外国人赴华旅游、商务、探亲或过境可适用三类免签制度。所有免签政策存在有效期，出行前请务必核对国家移民管理局最新公告。",
  "introPara2":"Unilateral visa-free, mutual visa exemption and 240-hour transit visa-free have different stay-lengths, eligibility rules and permitted activities. Use the search box or country list below to look up rules for your nationality. If your country is not covered by any visa-free arrangement, you will need to apply for a Chinese visa in advance.",
  "introPara2Zh":"单方面免签、互免签证、240小时过境免签在停留时长、适用条件、允许活动上有明确区别。使用搜索框或下方国家列表查询本国入境规则；若你的国家不在免签范围内，则需要提前申请中国签证。",
  "disclaimer":"Disclaimer: This site is an independent informational reference, NOT an official government website. All information is compiled from NIA public releases. Confirm entry rules with official sources before travel.",
  "disclaimerZh":"免责声明：本站仅为独立资讯参考网站，并非政府官方站点。全部信息整理自国家移民管理局公开公告，出行前请以官方渠道核实入境规则。",
  "expiryNote":"Policy Expiry Reminder: Most unilateral 30-day visa-free policies expire on 31-Dec-2026. Russian citizens’ unilateral visa-free is valid until 31-Dec-2027. Brunei holds unlimited unilateral visa-free access. Mutual agreements follow bilateral treaty terms.",
  "expiryNoteZh":"政策到期提醒：绝大多数单方面30天免签政策将于2026-12-31到期；俄罗斯单方面免签有效期至2027-12-31；文莱单方面免签无截止期限；互免签证按双边协定有效期执行。",
