      "q":"What documents do I need for visa-free entry into China?",
      "qZh":"免签入境中国我需要准备哪些材料？",
      "a":"Valid passport with ≥6-month validity, sufficient blank pages. It is strongly recommended to carry onward/return flight tickets and proof of accommodation. Visa-free entry does not guarantee admission; final decision rests with border inspection.",
      "aZh":"有效期≥6个月的护照并留有足够空白签证页；建议备好离境机票、住宿预订单。免签资格不等于一定允许入境，最终由边检确定。"
    },
    {
      "q":"Can I work or study under visa-free status?",
      "qZh":"免签入境可以工作或者读书吗？",
      "a":"No. Visa-free entry cannot be used for paid work, employment, internships or formal study. You must apply for the corresponding Chinese visa before arrival for these activities.",
      "aZh":"不可以。免签入境禁止务工、受雇、实习、正式留学；从事以上活动必须提前办理对应类型中国签证。"
    },
    {
      "q":"Can I extend my visa-free stay after arriving in China?",
      "qZh":"免签入境后可以在中国境内延期停留吗？",
