    {
      "q":"What if my country is not on any visa-free list?",
      "qZh":"我的国家不在任何免签清单该怎么办？",
      "a":"You must apply for a Chinese tourist/business visa from Chinese embassies or consulates before travelling to China.",
      "aZh":"你必须出行前在中国驻外使领馆申请中国旅游或商务类签证。"
