    {
      "q":"What is the difference between unilateral and mutual visa-free?",
      "qZh":"单方面免签与互免签证有什么区别？",
      "a":"Unilateral visa-free: China allows foreign citizens entry visa-free, without reciprocal treatment for Chinese passport holders. Mutual visa-free: both countries grant visa-free access to each-other’s ordinary passport holders under bilateral treaties.",
      "aZh":"单方面免签：中国单方面给予对方公民免签，中国护照持有人不一定享受对方免签；互免签证：两国通过双边协定互相给予普通护照持有人免签待遇。"
